# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to `.env.local` for development, or set in the Vercel dashboard for
# production. NEVER commit a real .env file — it is in .gitignore.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The base URL every API call is prefixed with.
#
# Vite inlines import.meta.env.VITE_* at BUILD time, not at runtime. Changing
# this value therefore requires a REBUILD, not just a restart of the app. That
# is the single most common confusion when "I changed the env var and nothing
# happened".
#
# Options:
#   https://<your-gateway>.onrender.com   talk to the gateway directly (default)
#   /api                                  same-origin, proxied by Vercel (see vercel.json)
VITE_API_URL=https://shopeease-gateway.onrender.com

# Vercel (production build in CI)
# VERCEL_TOKEN=
# VERCEL_ORG_ID=
# VERCEL_PROJECT_ID=
#
# Remember: the gateway's CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS must include this app's exact
# origin, or every browser request fails at the preflight while Postman works.
